<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Sense Life</h1>
<p>Sphere: Detection Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Druid (guild level 1), Necromancer (guild level 2), Ranger (guild level 6), Dark Knight (guild level 9), Healer (guild level 14)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast sense life &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast sense life</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>For a while after this spell, the target senses life they can't see. When 
they look around, they get a feeling: "You sense a hidden life form in the 
room." It doesn't say who or where, only that someone hidden or invisible is 
there. It also makes it much harder to ambush them.
</p><p>The better your detection sphere, the longer it lasts: from a minute up to 
several minutes. You must be standing, not fighting. It is also found on 
potions and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hide</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Ambush</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detect Invisible</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>